
### Database health 
GET http://localhost:3000/health/database

### GET requests 
### Get all movies 
GET http://localhost:3000/movies
### Get existing movie 
GET http://localhost:3000/movies/1
### Get non-existent movie
GET http://localhost:3000/movies/100

### POST requests
### Post valid
POST http://localhost:3000/movies/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Lapin sota",
    "director": "Aku Louhimies",
    "year": 2026

} 

### Post invalid 
POST http://localhost:3000/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "director": "Aku Louhimies",
    "year": 2026

} 


### PUT requests
### Put complete
PUT http://localhost:3000/movies/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Sherlock Holmes",
    "director": "Guy Ritchie",
    "year": 2010
} 

### Put incomplete 
PUT http://localhost:3000/movies/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Sherlock Holmes",
    "director": "Guy Ritchie",
    "year": 2010
} 

###PATCH requests 
### Patch complete
PATCH http://localhost:3000/movies/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Tuntematon Sotilas",
    "year": 2017
}

### Patch incomplete
PATCH http://localhost:3000/movies/4
Content-Type: application/json

{

}

